# - resource -------------------------------------------------------------------

<http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CapabilityStatement/CapabilityStatementLTCServer> a fhir:CapabilityStatement ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "CapabilityStatementLTCServer"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement CapabilityStatementLTCServer</b></p><a name=\"CapabilityStatementLTCServer\"> </a><a name=\"hcCapabilityStatementLTCServer\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">臺灣長期照顧實作指引 - 伺服端能力聲明</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 1.1.0 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>xml</code></li><li>Published on: 2024-12-19 </li><li>Published by: 經濟部產業發展署 </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>臺灣長期照顧實作指引伺服端必須支援以下 FHIR RESTful API 功能</p>\n</div><div class=\"lead\"><em>Security</em></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\">Enable CORS: yes</div><div class=\"col-lg-6\">Security services supported: <code>OAuth</code></div></div><blockquote><div><p>支援 OAuth 2.0 認證機制</p>\n</div></blockquote></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Bundle1-1\">Bundle</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Bundle</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCBundleReferral.html\">長期照顧管理中心個案服務初篩表/轉介單文件打包</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCBundleCMS.html\">照顧管理評估量表文件打包</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>type</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Composition1-2\">Composition</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/composition.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Composition</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCompositionReferral.html\">長期照護管理中心個案服務初篩表/轉介單文件架構</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCompositionCMS.html\">照顧管理評估量表文件架構</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, date, type</td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>Composition:author</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Patient1-3\">Patient</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/patient.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Patient</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCPatient.html\">長期照顧－住民基本資料</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCPatientReferral.html\">轉介單－個案基本資料</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCPatientCMS.html\">照顧管理評估量表－個案基本資料</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>identifier, name, birthdate, gender</td><td><code>Patient:organization</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#CarePlan1-4\">CarePlan</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/careplan.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/CarePlan</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCarePlan.html\">長期照顧－照顧計畫</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCarePlanReferral.html\">轉介單－服務種類</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, status, intent</td><td><code>CarePlan:subject</code>, <code>CarePlan:author</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#CareTeam1-5\">CareTeam</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/careteam.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/CareTeam</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCareTeam.html\">長期照顧－照顧團隊</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, status</td><td><code>CareTeam:subject</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Condition1-6\">Condition</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/condition.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Condition</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCondition.html\">長期照顧－病情、問題或診斷</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionCaregiver.html\">長期照顧－看護狀況</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionCrush.html\">長期照顧－壓傷狀況</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionDisability.html\">長期照顧－身心障礙手冊持有狀態</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionDisabilityType.html\">長期照顧－身心障礙類型</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionResidence.html\">長期照顧－居住狀況</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCConditionTube.html\">長期照顧－管路裝設狀況</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, code, clinical-status</td><td><code>Condition:subject</code>, <code>Condition:recorder</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Goal1-7\">Goal</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/goal.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Goal</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCGoal.html\">長期照顧－照顧目標</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, status</td><td><code>Goal:subject</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#MedicationAdministration1-8\">MedicationAdministration</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/medicationadministration.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/MedicationAdministration</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCMedicationAdministration.html\">長期照顧－用藥資料</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, medication, effective-time</td><td><code>MedicationAdministration:subject</code>, <code>MedicationAdministration:medication</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Observation1-9\">Observation</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCObservationFallingHistory.html\">安全防護－跌倒紀錄</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCObservationVitalSigns.html\">長期照顧－生命體徵</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, code, date</td><td><code>Observation:subject</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Organization1-10\">Organization</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/organization.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Organization</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-Organization-twltc.html\">長期照顧－機構</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>identifier, name</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Practitioner1-11\">Practitioner</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitioner.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Practitioner</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCPractitioner.html\">長期照顧－照顧服務提供者</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>identifier, name</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#PractitionerRole1-12\">PractitionerRole</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitionerrole.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/PractitionerRole</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCPractitionerRole.html\">長期照顧－服務人員角色</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>practitioner, organization</td><td><code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Questionnaire1-13\">Questionnaire</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaire.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Questionnaire</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaire.html\">長期照顧－問卷</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>identifier, title</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#QuestionnaireResponse1-14\">QuestionnaireResponse</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaireresponse.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/QuestionnaireResponse</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponse.html\">長期照顧－問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseADL.html\">ADL 問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSCommunication.html\">照顧管理評估量表－個案溝通能力問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSCaregiverLoad.html\">照顧管理評估量表－主要照顧者負荷問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSCaregiverSupport.html\">照顧管理評估量表－主要照顧者工作與支持</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSMemory.html\">照顧管理評估量表－個案短期記憶力問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSMental.html\">照顧管理評估量表－情緒及行為型態問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSSociety.html\">照顧管理評估量表－居家環境與社會參與問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseCMSSpecialCare.html\">照顧管理評估量表－特殊複雜照護需要問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseIADL.html\">IADL 問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseReferralCaregiver.html\">轉介單－照顧者問卷回覆</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCQuestionnaireResponseReferralSOF.html\">轉介單－衰弱評估問卷回覆</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>subject, questionnaire, authored</td><td><code>QuestionnaireResponse:subject</code>, <code>QuestionnaireResponse:questionnaire</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#RelatedPerson1-15\">RelatedPerson</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/relatedperson.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/RelatedPerson</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCRelatedPerson.html\">長期照顧－關係人</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>patient, relationship</td><td><code>RelatedPerson:patient</code></td><td><code>*</code></td><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Bundle1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Bundle</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html\">Bundle</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCBundleReferral.html\">長期照顧管理中心個案服務初篩表/轉介單文件打包</a><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCBundleCMS.html\">照顧管理評估量表文件打包</a></p></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <br/><code>read</code><div><p>支援讀取 Bundle 資源</p>\n</div><code>search-type</code><div><p>支援搜尋 Bundle 資源</p>\n</div><code>create</code><div><p>支援建立 Bundle 資源</p>\n</div><code>update</code><div><p>支援更新 Bundle 資源</p>\n</div></li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>type</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Bundle 類型</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Composition1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Composition</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/composition.html\">Composition</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCompositionReferral.html\">長期照護管理中心個案服務初篩表/轉介單文件架構</a><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-LTCCompositionCMS.html\">照顧管理評估量表文件架構</a></p></div><